 = 
# Apps and scripts
 + Return | Open terminal
 + Shift + Return | Open floating Kitty terminal
 + Q | Close active window
 + E | Open file manager
 + Shift + E | Open Yazi in Kitty
 + R | Open app launcher
 + B | Open default browser
 + Shift + B | Configure default browser
 + C | Clipboard history script
 + Alt + C | Clipboard history script
 + Alt + W | Clear clipboard history
 + Shift + D | Open emoji picker
 + L | Lock screen (hyprlock)
 + M | Exit Hyprland / run hyprshutdown if available
 + Y | Open default editor
 + Shift + Y | Configure default editor
 + W | Change wallpaper
 + Shift + W | Change Waybar layout
 + Shift + R | Change Rofi theme
 + A | Take screenshot
 + U | Run system updater in Kitty
 + Shift + I | Run Qylock SDDM script in Kitty
 + H | Show keybind help
 + X | Open wlogout power menu
 + Shift + C | Open color picker
 + T | Run theme-switch script
# Window management
 + V | Toggle floating for active window
 + Alt + V | Toggle floating
 + F | Toggle fullscreen
 + P | Toggle pseudo-tiling
 + J | Toggle split layout
 + Ctrl + H | Move window left
 + Ctrl + J | Move window down
 + Ctrl + K | Move window up
 + Ctrl + L | Move window right
 + Left click | Drag/move window
 + Right click | Resize window
# Focus
 + Left | Focus window to the left
 + Right | Focus window to the right
 + Up | Focus window above
 + Down | Focus window below
# Workspaces
 + 1–0 | Switch to workspace 1–10
 + Shift + 1–0 | Move window to workspace 1–10
 + Alt + 1–0 | Move window silently to workspace 1–10
 + S | Toggle special workspace "magic"
 + Shift + S | Move window to special workspace "magic"
 + Mouse scroll down | Switch to next workspace
 + Mouse scroll up | Switch to previous workspace
# Waybar and Hyprland
 + Ctrl + R | Reload Hyprland
Ctrl + Esc | Toggle Waybar (waybar-reload.sh --toggle)
Ctrl + Alt + Esc | Reload Waybar (waybar-reload.sh --reload)
# Window switcher
 + Tab | Open Rofi window switcher
Alt + Tab | Open Rofi window switcher with window theme
# Zoom (desktop magnifier)
 + Z | Toggle desktop zoom
 + Shift + Z | Increase desktop zoom
 + Alt + Z | Decrease desktop zoom
# Media and hardware keys
XF86AudioRaiseVolume | Increase volume
XF86AudioLowerVolume | Decrease volume
XF86AudioMute | Toggle audio mute
XF86AudioMicMute | Toggle microphone mute
XF86MonBrightnessUp | Increase screen brightness
XF86MonBrightnessDown | Decrease screen brightness
XF86AudioNext | Next media track
XF86AudioPause | Play/pause media
XF86AudioPlay | Play/pause media
XF86AudioPrev | Previous media track
